te, join methods. Explain. Cost vs benefit. Example: filter selectivity 1% on 1M orders: index scan vs seq. Use EXPLAIN ANALYZE.\n\n3 Indexing: data structures: B-tree, hash, GIN/GiST, bitmap. B-tree point lookup and range; composite indexes left-prefix; covering index avoids heap fetch; partial index. Index maintenance cost writes, space, fragmentation. Example: index on created",
